        "avatar": "https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/Pk2hhSgJ2-DUh7IkhGYOUw6-63SwKk0v2CE-2-5ARaGtALR1My2ZRIU8jbD40jMSI3ifYXd6H3LPlDfs6o2q_WvalyXCGgcOS00j2xpZJ347yOmc-gmIXwWK753nvfHEpfLf38IBIZ97K6sKjKryoK84ZkfVpuucDTG1m2FxrUxL9cxVeMMuEclJ8n_XvEjHXTmXMZBNTzLh6bV7Zi5nzun9CEQExRfa16CxBPfynV7y2Qt3wwl4QrLRy_xMZs5kvbbmzr6mFgckie9zY7mvJlklB_Xwd4TC5PnB-qAS5YqwzzBgbMSrcUYga8uJaxBXOm9m2BV-U3jgC_z_y34kXg.jpg"
      },
      "sourceId": "de:antifaaufklaerung",
